// B: 문 몸통만 16행 단축해 높이 32px, 손잡이 재배치; 윗면·처마·흰 칠·금장·접지선 유지.
@size 32 48
@cell 16
@palette palette.pal
@mat a white 0
@mat b white 1
@mat c white 2
@mat d white 3
@mat e white 4
@mat f white 5
@mat i gold 2
@mat j gold 3
@mat k gold 4
@mat l gold 5
@layer body
@mblock 0 16
= 3. 26i 3.
= 2. 1k 24e 2d 1i 2.
= 2. 1k 2f 7e 2d 13e 2d 1i 2.
= 2. 1k 24e 2d 1i 2.
= 2. 1k 26d 1i 2.
= 1. 1i 27l 1j 1i 1.
= 1. 1i 27k 1j 1i 1.
= 2. 27i 1j 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 23e 2c 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 3e 4d 16e 2c 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 23e 2c 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 23d 2c 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1l 23k 2j 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1l 8k 1i 1c 1b 1k 8j 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 1f 7e 1i 1c 1b 1k 1e 7d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2. *2
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 8e 1i 1c 1b 1k 8d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 2e 1d 5e 1i 1c 1b 1k 8d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 7e 1i 1i 1c 1b 1i 1i 7d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 7e 1l 1i 1c 1b 1k 1l 7d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2. *2
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 7e 1j 1i 1c 1b 1k 1j 7d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 8e 1i 1c 1b 1k 5d 1c 2d 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 1k 8d 1i 1c 1b 1k 8c 1i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 1k 10i 1c 1b 10i 1c 1b 1a 2.
= 2. 1b 1f 11d 1c 1b 11c 1b 1a 2. *3
= 1. 1i 27l 1j 1i 1.
= 1. 1i 27k 1j 1i 1.
= 2. 1b 25d 1c 1a 2.
= 2. 28b 2.
